==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Sneasel|85}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*'''Double Scratch''' is a variant of {{m|Scratch}}, a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Sneasel}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

